## Why This Is Asked
On-device updates for ML models are common in production apps. This tests versioning, secure delivery, atomic swaps, and rollback, all under memory constraints, with observable telemetry.

## Key Concepts
- CoreML model versioning and hash verification
- Background transfers and atomic filesystem swap
- Safe in-memory model reloading and rollback path
- Telemetry for swap success/failure and model health

